WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:39.200
<b>Thunder</b>

3
00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:43.760
[sighs]

4
00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:49.700
[KAIDO]
Black Maria?

5
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.330
Wait a minute,
don't you have a job to do?

6
00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.910
A job? Why, whatever
could you mean?

7
00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:58.750
You're supposed to be
looking for my son!

8
00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.230
No, it wouldn't.

9
00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:01.460
[Black Maria chuckles]
But wouldn't it be nicer

10
00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:02.670
if I stayed here with you?

11
00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:06.370
[BLACK MARIA]
The other
Tobi Roppo may be insufferable,

12
00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.790
So I'll stay here and serve you.

13
00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.460
[Kaido laughs]
Fair enough!

14
00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:15.170
Let's not stand
on ceremony today!

15
00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:18.970
So what do you say?
Ya having fun, Orochi?

16
00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:26.200
[laughs]
Oh, you bet I am,
my good man!

17
00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.100
[Orochi chuckles]

18
00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.310
For 20 longs years,
we've been haunted

19
00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:32.440
by the ghosts of
the Kozuki Clan,

20
00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:34.320
but they've been
vanquished at last!

21
00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.320
We have much to celebrate!

22
00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:39.570
Kanjuro deceived them
to the very last second!

23
00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:41.740
His grand performance
has come to an end,

24
00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:45.040
so I imagine he'll be
joining us at any moment!

25
00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:47.330
The same goes for
the battleship captains

26
00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:51.670
who sent those Akazaya samurai
to a watery grave!

27
00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.670
Kanjuro's impressive!

28
00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.740
To think I almost
killed him by accident

29
00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:00.960
in our battle
all those years ago.

30
00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:03.050
Maybe so, but that doesn't mean

31
00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.090
Oden trusted him
with everything.

32
00:03:05.090 --> 00:03:06.880
Certainly not with
the secrets he discovered

33
00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.840
on his trip across the seas.

34
00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.600
But if Kanjuro wasn't told,

35
00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.470
then the other samurai
weren't told either.

36
00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.680
Still thinking about that?

37
00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.230
Of course.

38
00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:20.270
Oden knew the exact
location of Laugh Tale,

39
00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:23.820
the last island that
Roger's crew reached.

40
00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:24.940
[Beast Pirate A groans] [Beast Pirate B groans]

41
00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.020
[Beast Pirate A screams]
Who is this guy?!

42
00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:35.480
[chuckles]

43
00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.360
Do pardon the intrusion.

44
00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.450
I must converse
with Lord Orochi.

45
00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:43.160
[gasps]
Kanjuro! You made it!

46
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.740
[BEAST PIRATE C]
Is he one of us?

47
00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.080
[BEAST PIRATE D]
Either way,
he's trying to start a fight!

48
00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.330
[sighs]

49
00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.130
The man works for
Orochi, you morons!

50
00:03:52.130 --> 00:03:53.750
Everyone stand down!

51
00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.590
[KANJURO]
Please forgive me, my lord.

52
00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:59.180
I'm quite late. I lost my way.

53
00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:01.840
This castle is much like a maze.

54
00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:04.350
<b>Kurozumi Kanjuro
Shogun Orochi's Informant</b>

55
00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.430
[KANJURO]
Furthermore, I was mistaken

56
00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:06.810
for an enemy more than once

57
00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:09.980
and was forced to strike down
a number of guards.

58
00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:12.270
Again, my apologies.

59
00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:16.240
Oh well! That is
too bad for them! [laughs]

60
00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:19.150
I see that you've brought
a gift for me!

61
00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:23.950
As you requested,
this is Kozuki Momonosuke.

62
00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:27.450
Can you believe he's Oden's son?

63
00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:30.790
The boy cut the ropes

64
00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:30.840
and attempted to
escape along the way.

65
00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.000
and attempted to escape
along the way.

66
00:04:32.690 --> 00:04:38.220
[Orochi chuckles] [OrochiI chuckles]

67
00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:35.340
Rest assured,
he was disciplined.

68
00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:38.070
But do not fret.
He still breathes.

69
00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.030
[OROCHI]
How could you
do something so cruel

70
00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:40.350
to your former lord and heir
of the Kozuki Clan? [chuckles]

71
00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:43.600
to your former lord and heir
of Kozuki Clan? [chuckles]

72
00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.810
Quite a heartless one
you turned out to be!

73
00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.190
Now that my role is over,

74
00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.580
he's naught but
a lowly brat to me.

75
00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:51.710
[Orochi chuckles]

76
00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:53.250
I'm still surprised.

77
00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.380
I remember you from back then.

78
00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:59.090
It's hard to believe you were
one of the Akazaya Nine.

79
00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:02.300
Twenty years ago,
was it? Our battle.

80
00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:09.140
And you. I remember
our encounter, as well.

81
00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:13.270
Some son of the great Kozuki
Oden you turned out to be.

82
00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:16.320
You haven't changed
one bit, have you?

83
00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:21.700
Quite a disappointment,
isn't he?

84
00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:25.750
Seems that the only thing of
value that he has is his name.

85
00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:27.840
child.

86
00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.510
Oh, how could you dare

87
00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.100
beat this little boy
black and blue?

88
00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.390
[Orochi cackles]

89
00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.600
[gasps]

90
00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.070
[OROCHI]
I'll toast to that,
my good man!

91
00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.480
This one's for you!

92
00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:40.520
To Kanjuro, our sinister spy!
You do excellent work!

93
00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.940
To Kanjuro, our sinister spy!

94
00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.950
You do excellent work!

95
00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.820
[KANJURO]
Please, Lord Orochi!

96
00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:46.860
I do not deserve such praise,

97
00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.580
I do not deserve such praise for
I bring you unfortunate news.

98
00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.740
for I bring you
unfortunate news.

99
00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:50.780
The Straw Hats'
appearance prevented me

100
00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.700
The Straw Hats
appearance prevented me

101
00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.790
from halting the
Akazaya samurai.

102
00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.580
I have failed you.

103
00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.330
You should have told me sooner!

104
00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.660
[KANJURO]
That's not all.

105
00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:01.830
The rebel forces are
advancing towards Onigashima

106
00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:05.680
with the aid of 5,400 troops!

107
00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:08.150
[OROCHI]
You

108
00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.640
You blasted fool!

109
00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.860
Your absolute incompetence
will be the death of me!

110
00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:16.520
I sincerely apologize.

111
00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:20.150
But you informed me of the
rendezvous point at Tokage Port!

112
00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.110
Why didn't you slay them all?

113
00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.160
Your excuse better be damn good!

114
00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:28.290
I'm loathe to admit it,
but Kin'emon outsmarted me!

115
00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.500
This is a shock, since I have
known him for many years!

116
00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.710
Cunning is not a word I'd use
to describe his character.

117
00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.130
That sounds like a weak excuse!

118
00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.460
Now, Kanjuro! What do you know?

119
00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.220
Are the samurai
on their way here?

120
00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.430
Is there something else
you're not telling me?

121
00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:46.890
[FUKUROKUJU]
No reason to lose
your head yet, Shogun Orochi.

122
00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.850
We haven't seen
a single suspicious ship

123
00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.940
at the dock thus far.

124
00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:55.190
Our only concern is that
the trio of battleships

125
00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:58.320
that we sent out earlier
have yet to come back.

126
00:06:59.130 --> 00:06:59.240
Not to alarm you,
but there's a report that

127
00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.240
Not to alarm you,
but the Beast Pirates

128
00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:05.100
four pirates have been sighted
on the Performance Floor.

129
00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.810
[FUKUROKUJU]
Straw Hat Luffy.

130
00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.860
[FUKUROKUJU]
Pirate Hunter Zoro.

131
00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.610
[FUKUROKUJU]
Eustass "Captain" Kid.

132
00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:24.030
[FUKUROKUJU]
"Murder Machine" Killer.

133
00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:27.040
It's quite likely that their
pirate crews are also in tow

134
00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:29.500
and have infiltrated
the island somehow.

135
00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:32.750
If you knew all that,
why didn't you tell me?

136
00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.170
[FUKUROKUJU]
Master Queen was supposed to be

137
00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:35.590
handling the situation,

138
00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:38.050
so I thought it'd better
not to interrupt the banquet

139
00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.010
with this nonsense, sir.

140
00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:43.180
Whether they're here or not,
we're more than prepared.

141
00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:46.680
Our entire force is
here on Onigashima.

142
00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.350
Whatever challenge is presented,

143
00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:51.890
this is the safest place in
the country at this moment!

144
00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.570
[laughs]
That's a good point.
Have a drink, Orochi.

145
00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:00.900
Just relax.
Let me pour you a cup.

146
00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.720
[OROCHI]
No. I don't want to hear

147
00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:08.010
reassurances and platitudes.

148
00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:11.960
I won't be at ease until I know
all the samurai are dead!

149
00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:13.800
They will locate me!

150
00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:15.460
I must have faith!

151
00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.880
[LUFFY]
You gotta find
a way to survive, okay?

152
00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:21.510
Just hang on and we'll
come and rescue you!

153
00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:24.820
[Orochi grunts]

154
00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.900
I will persevere.

155
00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:30.380
Black Maria! Give him to me!

156
00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.860
There's one thing
we must not forget!

157
00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:32.970
This pathetic little brat
is still the enemy's leader! Ah!

158
00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:36.890
This pathetic little brat is
still the enemy's leader! Ah!

159
00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:41.060
Go prepare the stage
for an execution!

160
00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:41.200
I'll bring an end to
the Kozuki bloodline

161
00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.180
I'll bring an end to the Kozuki
bloodline in front of everyone!

162
00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:44.660
in front of everyone!

163
00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:44.770
Then the samurai's loyalty with
crumble right before my eyes!

164
00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.710
Then the samurai loyalty will
crumble right before my eyes!

165
00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:47.770
Then this will all be over!

166
00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:49.880
Then all this will all be over!

167
00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:53.900
[Orochi cackles]

168
00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:57.300
[MOMONOSUKE]
Luffy. Everyone.

169
00:08:58.450 --> 00:08:58.680
Father.

170
00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.180
[MOMONOSUKE]
Father.

171
00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:08.580
You're late! Stupid cat!
Are you-gara here?

172
00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.570
Sail: "Cat"

173
00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:09.710
[CAT VIPER]
Of course!

174
00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:12.170
We just climbed up
the waterfall!

175
00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:15.050
[Guardians cheering]

176
00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:16.010
[both scream]

177
00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:14.340
[Cat Viper laughs]

178
00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.910
<b>Guardians
Nekomamushi's Subordinates</b>

179
00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:19.680
Do you-gara even know
what day it is?

180
00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:23.770
Huh? Why, it's the night of
the Fire Festival, obviously!

181
00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.980
So we made it just in time!

182
00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:29.100
I'm afraid the verdict
is still out on that.

183
00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.650
We're almost there.

184
00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.570
We're on our way to the
northwest end of Onigashima.

185
00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:36.280
[CAT VIPER]
Sounds great!
I'll see you-gara there!

186
00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.460
[Dogstorm sighs]

187
00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:39.740
No, Cat! We can't wait!
Listen up!

188
00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:40.910
[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A]
Cu-lick.

189
00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:43.660
I see our old friend
is as flippant as ever!

190
00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:46.500
Shall we place bets on if
he makes it there in time?

191
00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.500
[laughs]

192
00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.630
I haven't seen Kitty since
we were separated years ago.

193
00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:54.260
I imagine he got big
like Doggy did.

194
00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.590
I can't wait.

195
00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.350
This is a damn mess!

196
00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:59.100
Did he leave late or what?

197
00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:00.310
The raid is starting,

198
00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:02.280
so how the hell's he
gonna make it in time?

199
00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.120
He's in a normal ship.

200
00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:08.000
The sea currents are far
too strong, except in the front.

201
00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.040
In that case, I hope Kin'emon
and Denjiro have reached

202
00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:13.000
the back entrance
without incident.

203
00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.120
Indeed.

204
00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.130
We're Lord Oden's retainers!

205
00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.590
We should avenge
our lord's death together!

206
00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:23.050
Lord Momonosuke,
we shall be there soon.

207
00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.150
[CAT VIPER]
Yep.

208
00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:33.590
[IZO]
Are they all right?

209
00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.670
[CAT VIPER]
Hm? You-gara expected otherwise?

210
00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.200
[CAT VIPER]
We were told that
everyone made it to the island,

211
00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:38.840
It must be done.

212
00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:42.170
so it's safe to assume that
the raid is well in progress!

213
00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:46.390
[IZO]
They call that lonely
little isle Onigashima now, huh?

214
00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:49.040
Funny how you guys left
long before I did,

215
00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.300
but we made it at the same time!

216
00:10:51.300 --> 00:10:53.130
I asked you to send
that message to Luffy,

217
00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:53.850
but I guess there was no need
for that in the end.

218
00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:57.480
[laughs]
I almost forgot!

219
00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.900
No reason to hang
on to this, then!

220
00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.730
Note: "I'll be late but I'll be there. -Marco"

221
00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:10.490
[IZO]
I still find it hard to
believe you got involved, Marco.

222
00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:13.540
Really? I always did
like Oden, though.

223
00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.170
This whole time I was ignorant
to how bad things had gotten

224
00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:22.420
around the Land of Wano.

225
00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.680
Word rarely makes it
past the borders, if ever,

226
00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:27.600
so there's no way
I would have known.

227
00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:30.310
It deserves much
better than this.

228
00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:33.100
That damn Kaido is to
blame for its suffering.

229
00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:36.810
Hold onto those feelings and use
them when we get to the isle.

230
00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:39.400
Let's not delay our
vengeance any further!

231
00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.940
We should discuss the plan.

232
00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:42.990
The raid's already underway.

233
00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:45.530
How do we join them but
keep it on the down low?

234
00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.490
I got something up my sleeve.

235
00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.780
You-gara just follow my lead.

236
00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:50.790
[gasps]

237
00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.540
[laughs]

238
00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:56.080
[NARRATOR]
As planned,
Denjiro leads his samurai,

239
00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:59.410
<b>Southern Forces

Denjiro's Group</b>

240
00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.670
the Southern Forces,
towards the rear of the castle.

241
00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:00.880
[gasps]

242
00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.460
[HYOGORO]
This was not in the blueprints.

243
00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:05.500
Take cover!

244
00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.620
Tobi Roppo? This means trouble.

245
00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.250
Don't you dare come back here
until you find him!

246
00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:14.300
[BEAST PIRATES]
Sir!

247
00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.630
Perfect, now this
I can work with.

248
00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.630
I know this idiot.

249
00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.050
Let me handle this.

250
00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:22.140
[SASAKI]
Who's there?

251
00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.890
[DENJIRO]
Do not be alarmed!

252
00:12:25.060 --> 00:12:28.560
Been a while, hasn't it?
Hey, Sasaki!

253
00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:30.690
<b>Sasaki
Soaring Six
Beast Pirates</b>

254
00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:29.890
Hey, it is you!

255
00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.150
I was told you weren't
coming this year!

256
00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:34.360
It's a surprise,
so don't tell anyone.

257
00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.690
What's with the get up?

258
00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.070
You look weird
without your pompadour!

259
00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:40.860
I find it much stranger
that you're not at the feast.

260
00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.490
[SASAKI]
Yeah, yeah.

261
00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:45.660
Well, I can't enjoy myself till
the Commander's son turns up.

262
00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.870
Y'wanna throw one back with me?

263
00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.200
I'd love to!

264
00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.830
Listen up! I'll catch up
with you guys later!

265
00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.340
Head to the Skull Dome
without me.

266
00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:56.920
[NARRATOR]
Despite an unexpected obstacle

267
00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.550
and an encounter with
Sasaki of the Tobi Roppo

268
00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:02.380
Kyoshiro quickly turns
the situation around

269
00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:04.600
thanks to the trust he built
among the Beast Pirates

270
00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:05.800
over many years.

271
00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:09.020
He quietly leads
his foe into a trap.

272
00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:10.400
Sea Prism Stone?

273
00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:12.650
The hell're you doing? Get off!

274
00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:14.030
[DENJIRO]
Fetch the restraints!

275
00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:15.440
[SAMURAI]
Sir!

276
00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:19.160
This some kinda joke?
Release me!

277
00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.740
[DENJIRO]
Bind his mouth, too!

278
00:13:20.740 --> 00:13:21.820
[SAMURAI]
Yes, sir!

279
00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.870
Kyoshiro. Answer me!

280
00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:26.000
Calm down, Sasaki.

281
00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:30.620
Tell me. What do you know about
the Land of Wano's history?

282
00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.210
Huh? That tattoo!

283
00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.630
[NARRATOR]
After effortlessly besting

284
00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.300
one of the fearsome Tobi Roppo

285
00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.470
Denjiro splits
his group into two

286
00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.640
just as the Eastern Forces did.

287
00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.560
You can enter
the dome from there!

288
00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:49.480
Best of luck to you!

289
00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:53.600
<b>Dome

Infiltration

Team</b>

290
00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.520
[NARRATOR]
The ambush
on Kaido draws ever closer

291
00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:56.690
as the Southern Forces
steadily close in.

292
00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:56.940
<b>Raid Team</b>

293
00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:01.450
<b>Eastern

Forces



Kin'emon's

Group</b>

294
00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.790
We're not through! C'mere!

295
00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.580
I knew that it wouldn't work!

296
00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.080
We're gonna die!

297
00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:23.380
Oh, raccoon! Time to die!

298
00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.620
They distracted her!

299
00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.070
I hope they're safe!

300
00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:31.080
[SHINOBU]
Fierce and mature!

301
00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:34.480
[yells]

302
00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.980
How admirable of them both.

303
00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.690
Even fleeing in terror,
they lured her away.

304
00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:39.690
We're in your debt!

305
00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.110
Thank you, Commander Chopper.

306
00:14:41.110 --> 00:14:43.120
And you, Driver Usopp!

307
00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.780
Let us march forth!

308
00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:45.820
[SAMURAI]
Sir!

309
00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:46.870
[yells]

310
00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:47.280
Onward, men!

311
00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:51.250
[LUFFY grunts]

312
00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.960
We must not let their honorable
sacrifice go to waste!

313
00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:51.870
[SHINOBU]
Maybe we should
stop and assist them.

314
00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.040
They surely need our help
with that monster!

315
00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:57.210
What if she's too much woman
for those boys to handle?

316
00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:59.300
She has a point! It is Big Mom!

317
00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.590
And help how exactly?

318
00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.720
I don't think there's
anything we can do!

319
00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:05.930
We'll have to thank them for the
diversion when they get back!

320
00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:08.470
Jeez, why's it so hot in here?

321
00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:11.850
[ZEUS]
Nami! Above you!
We've got trouble!

322
00:15:11.850 --> 00:15:12.890
Huh?

323
00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.440
[Beast Pirate M groans] [all gasp]

324
00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:16.560
Finally found you!

325
00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:21.030
Hey Mama, the lady who kidnapped
Zeus is right over here!

326
00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.710
[all scream]

327
00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:21.710
[ULTI]
Pay-Pay! That's the way!

328
00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:26.130
Pay-Pay! That's the way!

329
00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:28.960
[PAGE ONE]
Can't you do that
down a different hallway,

330
00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:29.960
you idiot?

331
00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:31.590
[ULTI]
What was that, Pay-Pay?

332
00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:34.510
How about you say that
to my cute little face!

333
00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:40.480
How heartless!

334
00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.730
Would you treat me
like this if I was dying?

335
00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:46.280
Poor widdle Ulti! [cries]

336
00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:47.740
[PAGE ONE]
Don't be like that.

337
00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:49.730
If you're so tired,
just sit there!

338
00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:50.030
[ULTI]
That's not what
you're s'posed to say!

339
00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:53.080
[ULTI]
That's not what
you're supposed to say!

340
00:15:53.820 --> 00:15:55.240
[PAGE ONE]
Ah, crap!

341
00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:56.000
[ULTI]
This is the part where you offer

342
00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.200
[ULTI]
This is the part you offer

343
00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.710
to give me a piggyback ride!

344
00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:01.940
<b>Ulti and Page One
Soaring Six
Beast Pirates</b>

345
00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:03.750
Stop! Ease your grip!

346
00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:05.550
– Sis! Please!
– [ULTI] Say you're sorry!

347
00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:06.880
– [ULTI] Say you're sorry!
– [PAGE ONE] Come on!

348
00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:07.550
[PAGE ONE]
Come on! Stop messing around!

349
00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:09.680
[PAGE ONE]
Stop messing around!

350
00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.680
[Page One gasps]

351
00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:12.760
[ULTI]
Pay-Pay?

352
00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:16.140
[Beast Pirates groan]

353
00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.980
[PAGE ONE gasps]

354
00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:13.760
[Ulti gasps]

355
00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:19.020
You gotta stay with me, dammit!

356
00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:19.660
Oh, my poor, sweet
little Pay-Pay! Oh no!

357
00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.660
My poor, sweet
little baby brother!

358
00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.110
What was that?

359
00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:31.280
[yells]

360
00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:32.500
[ULTI]
Here lies

361
00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:33.320
[Ulti cries]

362
00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:37.570
He sacrificed his life for his
favorite person in the world!

363
00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:39.800
[Ulti crying]

364
00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:43.010
[ULTI]
Huh? Can't you see
I'm grieving here?

365
00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:45.580
Who the heck are you?

366
00:16:56.480 --> 00:16:58.950
[sighs]
That has
to be Onigashima.

367
00:16:58.950 --> 00:16:59.910
Hm?

368
00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:01.530
[USOPP]
You

369
00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:03.740
[PEROSPERO]
Curse you, King.

370
00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.840
And that damn Straw Hat.

371
00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:10.800
Mama's alliance, be damned.

372
00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:14.340
I'm going to wreak havoc
as soon as I get there!

373
00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.060
Anyone who dares to cross us

374
00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:19.430
will get the worst
licking of their lives!

375
00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.160
[gasps]

376
00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.120
[CHOPPER]
Actually, wait a second.

377
00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.200
There's a problem.

378
00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:27.160
I'm pretty sure Big Mom was
headed towards Nami's group!

379
00:17:27.160 --> 00:17:29.960
[USOPP]
She's probably gonna
try to take back Zeus.

380
00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.750
[CHOPPER]
So that means they're in danger.

381
00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:33.500
Musta been the damage
we just took.

382
00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.460
I think it accidentally
activated

383
00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.940
the transformation switch.

384
00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.860
[USOPP]
Don't worry,
they're gonna be fine.

385
00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:39.740
Sanji's with them, remember?

386
00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.400
[PAGE ONE]
Hey, you're choking me!

387
00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:41.980
I guess you're right.

388
00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.100
[CHOPPER]
Although, I hope
he doesn't get distracted

389
00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:48.110
by the pleasure hall and
can focus on saving Momonosuke!

390
00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:50.320
That is the risk
with him, unfortunately.

391
00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:53.200
[USOPP]
Well. Let's just
hope for the best.

392
00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:55.990
[CHOPPER]
All right!
At least Kin'emon's group

393
00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:58.000
can keep moving forward
thanks to us.

394
00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.830
So that's something!

395
00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.920
Glad we showed them
the Brachio Tank!

396
00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.840
Bet they thought
it was real cool!

397
00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.250
[USOPP]
Heck yeah!

398
00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.960
Between Commander Chopper,
Sniper-slash-Driver Usopp,

399
00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:12.550
and our tank,
those samurai must be in awe!

400
00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:14.550
Nothing can stop us now!

401
00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:18.540
<b>Inside

the

Pleasure

Hall</b>

402
00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:18.770
[Big Mom laughing]

403
00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:23.720
[Big Mom laughs]

404
00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:26.550
[BIG MOM]
Follow me, everyone!

405
00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:32.680
[BIG MOM]
Come here, little umbrella.

406
00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:33.980
[cackles]

407
00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:38.190
You too, old shoe.
Hurry along now.

408
00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:43.860
I want you, too, dirt wall!

409
00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:47.120
Yes, and you, candle!

410
00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:50.410
[growls]

411
00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.000
[BIG MOM]
Oh, lantern!

412
00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.330
[screams]

413
00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:01.340
[BIG MOM]
Join me and
I'll give you all life!

414
00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:05.550
Come along now, little homies.

415
00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:10.220
Mama! Look! Right here!

416
00:19:10.220 --> 00:19:11.680
Knock it off!

417
00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.680
Stop drawing attention
to us, stupid sun!

418
00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.310
We gotta do something.

419
00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:17.520
If Mama steals me back,

420
00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.940
then I'll be as good
as dead for sure!

421
00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:25.030
Is that overripe mature woman
really as dangerous as they say?

422
00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:28.280
She's all that and
then some, I promise you.

423
00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:30.830
Hold on. Wasn't Sanji
supposed to be here with us?

424
00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.130
Sanji?

425
00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:36.170
[Carrot gasps]
Yeah. I think?

426
00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:38.130
[SANJI]
Sorry for making you worry.

427
00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:38.170
I'll find those lovely ladies
no matter what!

428
00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:41.710
I'll find those lovely
ladies no matter what!

429
00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:45.510
[gasps]
Dependable
as ever, I guess!

430
00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.950
[gasps]
We'll just have to run.

431
00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:47.470
[BEAST PIRATE N]
Run

432
00:19:47.470 --> 00:19:50.390
We still have a mission
to rescue Lord Momonosuke!

433
00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.180
[gasps]
'Kay!

434
00:19:57.350 --> 00:20:00.980
Hey! Mama! Over this way!

435
00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:06.240
[laughs]
There's no
need to rush.

436
00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:09.360
The Performance Floor
is up ahead, correct?

437
00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.660
They'll be right
where we want 'em.

438
00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:16.750
[chuckles]

439
00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:17.540
[Beast Pirates chattering]

440
00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:23.280
I'm seeing people with
weird abilities everywhere I go.

441
00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:29.170
[chuckles]
Just call us Gifters.

442
00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:33.450
We all, at one time,
shared that same desire.

443
00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:35.250
Every one of us.

444
00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:36.420
[Beast Pirateschuckling]

445
00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.610
[MANTIS GIFTER A]
Things will be so much easier

446
00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.380
for you if you defect.

447
00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:42.090
[GIFTER A]
There's nearly 500 of us!

448
00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:41.070
[Killer grunts]

449
00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:42.470
[Beast Pirates groan]

450
00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.260
[GIFTER A]
It ain't so bad.

451
00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.720
Have a fresh start with us!

452
00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:51.290
[KILLER]
Kid! You sure you still
wanna take them head-on?

453
00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.870
Sneaking in would be easier.

454
00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:56.720
[Beast Pirates gasp]

455
00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:55.010
[KID]
Besides, we've already lost

456
00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:56.930
a buncha crewmates in the chaos.

457
00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:58.850
I'm sure they can make it
through on their own,

458
00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:59.700
<b>Wire
Kid Pirates Heat
Kid Pirates</b>

459
00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:02.190
but we gotta stick together
till we meet up again.

460
00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:01.600
[Beast Pirates yell]

461
00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:02.360
If I kill you,
I'll get promoted for sure!

462
00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.610
I'll get promoted for sure.

463
00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.730
Nothing personal, of course!

464
00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:10.250
[both grunting]

465
00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.630
[BEAST PIRATE W]
Please stop!

466
00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.210
[BEAST PIRATE X]
The commander
is looking for you!

467
00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:13.250
[YAMATO]
Leave me alone, all right?

468
00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.500
choking me!

469
00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:16.960
I've got places to be!

470
00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.380
[BEAST PIRATES]
Young Master! Please wait!

471
00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:21.340
[KID]
If you let your guard down,

472
00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:23.180
you might get yourself killed!

473
00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:28.810
[Beast Pirates groan] [Ulti growls]

474
00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:32.020
[Ulti whines]
Pay-Pay!

475
00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:37.360
Did you get a boo-boo?

476
00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:39.410
I'm ever-ever so happy
that you're okay!

477
00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:39.730
that?

478
00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:42.820
[Ulti cries]

479
00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:42.820
[Page One groans]

480
00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:44.410
What're you looking at?

481
00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:46.920
[ULTI]
How dare you!

482
00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:47.000
[Ulti gasps]
What?

483
00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:49.600
Whomst do you think you are,
hurting him like that?

484
00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:50.040
Only I'm allowed
to bully Pay-Pay!

485
00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:51.750
You're outta line, pal!

486
00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:01.090
Huh? You were the one
surfing on him down the stairs,

487
00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:02.970
I didn't touch him.

488
00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.260
[ULTI]
Who are you?

489
00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:06.640
What unit are you with?

490
00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:08.390
Who's your commanding officer?

491
00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:09.390
[PAGE ONE]
I don't think he's one of ours.

492
00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:10.220
[ULTI]
I was what?

493
00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:10.460
[ULTI]
Huh? What?

494
00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:11.470
[PAGE ONE]
Huh?

495
00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.640
[PAGE ONE]
He's an intruder.

496
00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:14.780
[ULTI]
The nerve!

497
00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:16.580
The name's Luffy.

498
00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:17.100
[Ulti gasps]

499
00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.330
The man who's gonna be
King of the Pirates!

500
00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:21.750
[Ulti gasps]

501
00:22:29.340 --> 00:22:32.380
[ULTI]
Excuse you? Oh, boy.

502
00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:34.180
Do you have the teeniest clue

503
00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:36.300
whose mansion
you stepped foot in?

504
00:22:36.300 --> 00:22:39.930
News flash! It belongs
to Commander Kaido,

505
00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:43.060
who's gonna be the real
King of the Pirates!

506
00:22:44.350 --> 00:22:46.940
[ULTI]
You're the dumbest
dummy in the world!

507
00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:51.490
[ULTI]
I'm going to
split your skull in two!

508
00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:54.320
[LUFFY]
A head-butt?

509
00:22:58.280 --> 00:23:00.620
[Luffy grunts]

510
00:23:28.200 --> 00:23:31.530
[PAGE ONE]
Hey, Sis.
Be careful of him, all right?

511
00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:33.740
[ULTI]
Yeah, got it.

512
00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:41.540
[ULTI]
Wanna help, Pay-Pay?

513
00:23:41.540 --> 00:23:42.880
[PAGE ONE]
Sure.

514
00:23:50.180 --> 00:23:55.680
[both grunting]

515
00:24:05.570 --> 00:24:11.530
[Ulti growls]

516
00:24:11.530 --> 00:24:15.080
[BEAST PIRATE AB]
Excuse me.
Is all this really necessary?

517
00:24:15.080 --> 00:24:18.370
Why would you resort to
transforming when he's down?

518
00:24:19.060 --> 00:24:22.900
<b>Ulti
Ancient Saur-Saur Fruit
Pachycephalosaurus</b>

519
00:24:19.720 --> 00:24:19.960
Now Gum-Gum...

520
00:24:19.960 --> 00:24:24.630
[BEAST PIRATE AB]
Lady Ulti?

521
00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:27.900
<b>Page One
Ancient Saur-Saur Fruit
Spinosaurus</b>

522
00:24:24.630 --> 00:24:26.460
[BEAST PIRATE AB]
Page One, sir?

523
00:24:29.050 --> 00:24:30.300
[BEAST PIRATE AB]
Maybe I'm out of line,

524
00:24:30.300 --> 00:24:31.260
but this seems excessive.

525
00:24:31.260 --> 00:24:33.340
[ULTI]
Shut your damn mouth!

526
00:24:34.220 --> 00:24:36.810
I can make up my own mind.

527
00:24:36.810 --> 00:24:40.810
And we already decided that
this guy's a dangerous enemy!

528
00:24:40.810 --> 00:24:41.850
[BEAST PIRATE AC]
I dunno, ma'am!

529
00:24:41.850 --> 00:24:43.310
He looks pretty dead to me.

530
00:24:43.310 --> 00:24:45.270
You cracked his head open!

531
00:24:49.440 --> 00:24:51.070
[Ulti gasps]

532
00:24:51.070 --> 00:24:53.570
[ULTI]
Then where the hell is
all that Haki coming from, huh?

533
00:24:53.570 --> 00:24:56.410
That hurt! Hey!

534
00:24:57.090 --> 00:25:00.220
[LUFFY]
Gum-Gum...

535
00:25:00.220 --> 00:25:02.480
...Elephant Gun!

536
00:25:02.480 --> 00:25:03.670
[Luffy grunts]

537
00:25:03.670 --> 00:25:06.250
You guys are tougher
than you look.

538
00:25:06.250 --> 00:25:08.260
Didn't see that coming.

539
00:25:09.100 --> 00:25:12.480
Guess I underestimated you.

540
00:25:12.480 --> 00:25:14.440
It won't happen again.

541
00:25:16.320 --> 00:25:19.360
This is an Emperor's
home turf after all.

542
00:25:19.360 --> 00:25:22.190
[microphone feedback]

543
00:25:22.190 --> 00:25:25.360
[QUEEN]
Listen up, shitheads!

544
00:25:25.170 --> 00:25:31.090
<b>Performance

Floor



Skull Dome</b>

545
00:25:25.360 --> 00:25:28.200
Sorry to interrupt your
scheduled drinking,

546
00:25:28.200 --> 00:25:31.700
but Shogun Orochi has
a special event for you!

547
00:25:31.700 --> 00:25:34.600
[Beast Pirates cheer]

548
00:25:34.600 --> 00:25:37.180
Hello? Testing.
Is this thing on?

549
00:25:37.180 --> 00:25:39.480
Good. Welcome, all!

550
00:25:39.480 --> 00:25:43.640
I come to you this evening
with a real treat!

551
00:25:42.650 --> 00:25:46.570
[panting]

552
00:25:46.310 --> 00:25:49.060
Does anyone recognize this boy?

553
00:25:49.060 --> 00:25:51.360
You're looking at
Kozuki Oden's son!

554
00:25:51.360 --> 00:25:54.240
He was thought to be
dead 20 years ago!

555
00:26:17.380 --> 00:26:19.380
[ULTI]
Now you've done it!

556
00:26:27.520 --> 00:26:29.400
[ULTI]
Ulti-Meteor!

557
00:26:44.720 --> 00:26:45.680
[grunts]

558
00:26:45.680 --> 00:26:47.060
[Page One groans]

559
00:26:47.060 --> 00:26:49.520
[Beast Pirate AD]
Are you okay?
That looked bad!

560
00:26:49.520 --> 00:26:51.310
[BEAST PIRATE AE]
Page One, sir!

561
00:26:53.560 --> 00:26:56.760
[ULTI]
Listen here, you slimeball.

562
00:26:56.760 --> 00:27:00.360
You've got some nerve
hurting Pay-Pay!

563
00:27:01.140 --> 00:27:06.600
[gasps, groans]

564
00:27:01.900 --> 00:27:03.100
[gasps]

565
00:27:02.950 --> 00:27:06.600
[Ulti yells]

566
00:27:06.600 --> 00:27:08.950
[ULTI]
I'm gonna crush you!

567
00:27:08.950 --> 00:27:11.200
[BEAST PIRATE AF]
Lady Ulti
pulled out her dinosaur form!

568
00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:12.790
[BEAST PIRATE AG]
Please! This place can't take

569
00:27:12.790 --> 00:27:13.770
this kind of damage!

570
00:27:13.770 --> 00:27:14.990
Ulti-Meteor!

571
00:27:14.990 --> 00:27:16.870
[LUFFY]
That's a good grip.

572
00:27:16.870 --> 00:27:18.910
She's really strong!

573
00:27:19.610 --> 00:27:24.330
[Luffy grunts]

574
00:27:19.610 --> 00:27:23.530
[Ulti grunting]

575
00:27:25.120 --> 00:27:29.000
[Ulti grunts]

576
00:28:15.920 --> 00:28:19.130
[panting]

577
00:28:24.260 --> 00:28:27.680
[panting]

578
00:28:51.540 --> 00:28:53.540
[YAMATO]
Straw Hat Luffy!

579
00:28:53.540 --> 00:28:57.250
[gasps]

580
00:28:57.250 --> 00:28:59.380
[YAMATO]
It's really you, isn't it?

581
00:29:04.340 --> 00:29:05.720
Uh, yeah?

582
00:29:05.720 --> 00:29:10.720
[Yamato squeals]
I... I...

583
00:29:11.520 --> 00:29:16.520
[Yamato squeals]

584
00:29:16.520 --> 00:29:19.110
[gasps]

585
00:29:19.110 --> 00:29:20.320
[LUFFY]
What's going on?

586
00:29:20.320 --> 00:29:21.400
[BEAST PIRATE AH]
They're getting away!

587
00:29:21.400 --> 00:29:22.530
[BEAST PIRATE AI]
Master Yamato!

588
00:29:22.530 --> 00:29:23.780
[BEAST PIRATE AJ]
Seize them!

589
00:29:23.780 --> 00:29:30.320
[Beast Pirates shouting]

590
00:29:30.320 --> 00:29:34.430
[YAMATO]
Forgive me!
I swear, I mean you no harm!

591
00:29:34.430 --> 00:29:37.890
[Yamato yells]

592
00:29:37.890 --> 00:29:40.900
[LUFFY]
All right.
Y'seem like a good person,

593
00:29:40.900 --> 00:29:42.440
but put me down.

594
00:29:42.440 --> 00:29:45.610
You hear me?
There's something I gotta do!

595
00:29:45.940 --> 00:29:48.570
[YAMATO]
The day has finally come!

596
00:29:49.660 --> 00:29:53.330
[YAMATO]
Now, I understand
this may sound odd.

597
00:29:53.330 --> 00:29:57.000
But I've anticipated this
for quite some time.

598
00:29:57.800 --> 00:29:58.150
[YAMATO]
I've been waiting for you!

599
00:29:58.150 --> 00:30:00.740
I've been waiting for you!

600
00:30:07.290 --> 00:30:13.350
[YAMATO]
My name is Yamato!
I'm Kaido's son!
